  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Preparation for Organic Ginger Powder Processing Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proganic B.V. specialises in the cultivation, packaging, transport and sale of high-quality organic products (mainly avocados) on the European market where strict food safety and sustainability standards apply.Since 2022, the company has concentrated its activities in Tanzania, taking advantage of the favourable climate for organic farming. The company has a trading office in the Netherlands to manage the international supply chain.Tanzania has a significant ginger production, but most locally grown varieties do not meet the strict quality standards. This is partly due to limited access to high-quality ginger varieties, lack of post-harvest infrastructure and insufficient training of farmers. The company now plans to introduce a new ginger variety, improve processes and quality controls and focus on both raw ginger production and processing into dried ginger and ginger powder.Proganic plans to invest in a modern ginger processing facility with its main activities of washing, cutting, drying and packaging organic ginger, which will meet international quality and safety standards. However, in order to ensure a consistent and sufficient supply of high-quality organic ginger, the company plans to develop its own plots and at the same time partner with local small-scale farmers, supporting them through training, high-quality seed varieties, certification programmes and contract farming models.</narrative>
  </description>
